  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 514.01 Color of Plates.\n\n(a) Registration plates shall have color combinations as follows:\n\n(1) Temporary 20 day plate issued by the department - brown on white; and\n\n(2) Supplemental repair plate issued by the department – orange on white.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 515.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
